flowchart LR
  Request[COMPILE_CONTEXT]
  Scope[Scope + Query + Kind]
  Candidates[List Snapshot Candidates]
  Score[Deterministic Scoring]
  Decision{Score >= Threshold?}
  Restore[Header-first Restore Package]
  Fresh[Fresh Compile Required]
  Persist[Persist Snapshot Metadata]

  Request --> Scope --> Candidates --> Score --> Decision
  Decision -->|yes| Restore --> Persist
  Decision -->|no| Fresh --> Persist

